{"id": 74, "name": "Minsitthar", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/8/83/Hero741-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142435", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Initiator", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["60", "40", "80", "40"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", "Roam"], "story": "A young king that led the people of Mahar Pura to victory against invaders.", "skills": [{"name": "Mark of the King", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b8a08e978ceeacea5127e4503de0611b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Minsitthar's Basic Attacks and skills apply a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mark of the King</span>, up to 5 stacks. Upon reaching max stacks, the next attack detonates all <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mark of the King</span> stacks, dealing <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> equal to 400<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+6% Total HP)</span> of Minsitthar's Max HP and stunning the target for 0.8s while healing Minsitthar for 400<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+6% Total HP)</span> HP. Can only trigger once every 6s on the same target."}, {"name": "Spear of Glory", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b6b93437d70ecd419f9f836e05842008.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13   Mana Cost: 95", "desc": "Minsitthar thrusts forward with the Spear of Glory, dealing 175<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing enemies hit by 30%. Enemy heroes hit by the tip of the spear will be stunned for 0.6s. After a short delay, Minsitthar pulls back the spear, dealing 175<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to all enemies along the way and dragging enemy heroes hit to him."}, {"name": "Shield Assault", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b3c57f1f179d03eba8a27d72cc4e6702.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 63, "tagname": "Reduce DMG", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Minsitthar awakens the power in his shield and releases it, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to all enemies in a rectangular area and slowing them by 80% (decaying rapidly over 2s). Meanwhile, he enters <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phalanx</span> state for 3s, reducing damage taken from the front by 25% and enhancing his Basic Attack to swiftly strike an area in front of him for 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> per hit."}, {"name": "King's Calling", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d1da161bc8087d39ae7e3e50febef4f0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 55   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Minsitthar charges forward and calls 4 Royal Guards to form a field around him. The Royal Guards cannot move but will attack enemies in the field and deal <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to them.\nEnemies in the field are slowed by 30% and cannot use movement skills."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Rapid Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d68aaf3f8586be360a0b4058d15d2775.png"}, {"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a89